{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103760","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103760","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710376001:1":{"text":"伯恩！汇报一下情况。圣古堂消失的原址有何异常吗？","source_cn":"伯恩！汇报一下情况。圣古堂消失的原址有何异常吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BEDBBB5D68B6D66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710376002:1":{"text":"报告队长！目前原址没有任何动静。也没有任何人靠近或试图闯入！","source_cn":"报告队长！目前原址没有任何动静。也没有任何人靠近或试图闯入！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE806201E1EFB305E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710376003:1":{"text":"那么……失踪人员呢？有没有佩吉公主，或者亨德里克司令的消息？","source_cn":"那么……失踪人员呢？有没有佩吉公主，或者亨德里克司令的消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D4B751C368A246F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710376004:1":{"text":"关于这个，我们刚刚接到了紧急通报。司令他现身了！","source_cn":"关于这个，我们刚刚接到了紧急通报。司令他现身了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD0A52D9BA58077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710376005:1":{"text":"父——司令回来了？！他在哪里？","source_cn":"父——司令回来了？！他在哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF911FED27FDD37D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c